@startuml seq_monthly_rate_calculation
title Monthly Rate Calculation - Sequence Diagram \nMonthlyRateCalculationCommand

skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 2
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #333333
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #FAFAFA
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #999999
skinparam noteBorderColor #F9A825
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFDE7

actor       "Scheduler / Admin"         as admin
participant "MonthlyRateCalculationCommand"  as cmd
participant "CommonUtil"                as util
participant "MonthlyRateCalculationLogic"   as logic
database    "trn_student_product"       as sp
database    "trn_charge"                as charge
database    "mst_product"               as product
database    "trn_ticket"                as ticket
database    "trn_evaluation"            as eval
database    "trn_prorated_refund_charge" as refund
database    "log_monthly_rate_calculation" as log_mrc

== Initialisation ==

admin  -> cmd   : php artisan command:MonthlyRateCalculationCommand {exeDate}
cmd    -> util  : setSystemDate(exeDate)
cmd    -> util  : getTargetFromTo()\n→ [startDate, endDate]\n  e.g. 2026-02-01 ~ 2026-02-28
cmd    -> logic : execute(startDate, endDate)

== Transaction Begin ==

logic  -> logic : DB::beginTransaction()\n[mysql + zipan]

== CTE Query Execution ==

note over logic
  Single large WITH RECURSIVE SQL query
  covering all students in one pass
end note

logic  -> sp      : READ trn_student_product\nWHERE main_product=1 AND status=1\n(StudentProduct CTE)
logic  -> product : READ mst_product\nWHERE lesson_type=2\n(ProductVolume CTE)
logic  -> charge  : READ trn_charge\nWHERE status=1 AND paid=1\nLEFT JOIN trn_prorated_refund_charge\n(ChargeData CTE)
logic  -> refund  : READ trn_prorated_refund_charge\n(LEFT JOIN in ChargeData CTE)
logic  -> ticket  : READ trn_ticket\nWHERE ticket_type=3\nAND end_datetime >= startDate\nAND start_datetime <= endDate\n(TicketMonths CTE — recursive)
logic  -> eval    : READ trn_evaluation\nWHERE ticket_type=3\nAND status IN(0,1)\nAND result IN(0,1,2,3,4)\n(EvaluationFilter CTE)

note over logic
  CTEs computed in-database:
  MonthlyUsage → FilteredUsage →
  OrderedMonths → Grouped →
  GroupedWithOrderCheck → FinalResult
  WHERE target_ym = YYYYMM
end note

logic  -> logic : Fetch bizRows (mysql)\nFetch zipanRows (zipan)

== Result Handling ==

alt No rows generated
    logic -> logic : rollBack()\nLog warning: no_rows_generated
else Rows exist
    logic -> log_mrc : INSERT INTO log_monthly_rate_calculation\n(bizmates rows)
    logic -> log_mrc : INSERT INTO log_monthly_rate_calculation\n(zipan rows)
    logic -> logic   : DB::commit()\n[mysql + zipan]
end

logic --> cmd : return
cmd   --> admin : Command::SUCCESS

@enduml
